  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Energy Partnership Programme (DEPP 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme supports capacity building cooperation between the Danish Energy Agency and relevant energy authorities in Mexico, China, Vietnam and South Africa. The objective is to increase national ambitions for national determined contributions under the COP arrangement and facilitate implementation of CO&quot; reductions in the energy sector.</narrative>
